Location

Global (remote)

Status

Ongoing

Immediate Result

Ekosistem tooling dan infrastructure tumbuh (Keplr, Leap, Mintscan, CosmWasm, dll); developer onboarding dipercepat.

Sources

https://interchain.io/grants/; https://blog.cosmos.network/icf-grants-update/

